# Portfolio Configuration

# 1. Contact Form Email Integration
# Sign up at https://web3forms.com/ (free, no registration required) to get your Access Key.
# Drop it here to enable real form submissions directly to your inbox.
VITE_CONTACT_SERVICE_KEY="bc9213ca-c826-4e61-a1a4-97c0b54cb698"

# (Optional) You can replace this with a different endpoint (e.g., Formspree, custom API)
VITE_CONTACT_SERVICE_ENDPOINT="https://api.web3forms.com/submit"

# 2. hCaptcha Spam Protection (Optional)
# If hCaptcha is enabled in your Web3Forms settings, enter your hCaptcha Site Key here.
VITE_HCAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=""

